#   brew bundle install --file packages/Brewfile --no-upgrade
# only when the owner opted in for this apply with AGENT_ENV_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1.
# Homebrew does not pin versions, so this list holds only unpinned base tools. Pinned tools
# (node, uv, gh, oh-my-posh, codex) come from mise; see packages/mise-tools.toml.
# Tailscale is installed separately, and only when no Tailscale app is present, because
# brew cannot adopt an App Store or standalone-pkg install.
